<div class="mt-4 bg-white/70 backdrop-blur border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl px-4 py-3 flex items-start gap-3">
<div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-indigo-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-black shrink-0 mt-0.5">i</div>
<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed"><b class="text-slate-800">Grammar Tip:</b> Use <b>doesn't</b> with <i>he / she / it</i> (Sara, Ali, the cat) and <b>don't</b> with <i>I / you / we / they</i>. The verb after never gets an <b>-s</b>!</p>
