<div class="bg-white rounded-[24px] shadow-2xl max-w-lg w-full overflow-hidden" style="animation:pop 0.5s ease">
<div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 to-violet-600 p-6 sm:p-8 text-white relative overflow-hidden">
<div class="absolute -right-8 -top-8 w-32 h-32 bg-white/10 rounded-full"></div>
<div class="absolute -left-4 -bottom-6 w-20 h-20 bg-white/10 rounded-full"></div>
<div class="relative">
<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/20 backdrop-blur px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] font-black tracking-widest">✨ INTERACTIVE GRAMMAR WORKSHEET</div>
<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black mt-3 leading-none">Grammar Drop!</h1>
<p class="text-indigo-100 mt-2 text-sm sm:text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Exactly like your paper worksheet — but drag & drop! Master <b class="text-white">don't</b> vs <b class="text-white">doesn't</b> in 10 fun sentences.</p>
